    "description": "“We Can Never Do Merely One Thing”\n\nThe upcoming session will focus on second-order effects, uncertainty, and the challenge of thinking beyond the obvious. Drawing from his experiences in science, nature, and conservation, Pethiyagoda will explore how even well-intentioned actions can create unexpected consequences.\n\nEvent Details&nbsp;<div><ul><li>&nbsp;📅 17 August 2026&nbsp;</li><li>🕠 5:30 PM onwards&nbsp;</li><li>📍 Bay 07, TRACE Expert City, Colombo 10&nbsp;</li></ul></div><div>&nbsp;An Opportunity to Meet Rohan Pethiyagoda\n</div>",
