    "description": "<!--StartFragment--><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: docs-Roboto; font-size: 14.6667px;\">We invite you to the&nbsp;latest edition of&nbsp;<b>The SHED</b>&nbsp;series, where we&nbsp;explore the latest innovations in climate and earth&nbsp;technologies<strong>.&nbsp;</strong>This exclusive event will bring together innovators, sustainability experts and thought leaders in this field, providing a platform for rich and insightful discussions on the evolving landscape of climate and earth tech.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: docs-Roboto; font-size: 14.6667px;\"><b>Event details:</b><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: docs-Roboto; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Date - 06 Octomber 2026</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: docs-Roboto; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Time - 5 PM onwards</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: docs-Roboto;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">Venue -&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/HRxidmWDbGgZy9uz6\" style=\"color: rgb(11, 87, 208);\"><font style=\"font-size: 12px;\">Bay 7, TRACE Expert City, Colombo 10</font></a></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: docs-Roboto; font-size: 14.6667px;\">Kindly confirm your participation by completing the Google Form.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: docs-Roboto; font-size: 14.6667px;\">We look forward to seeing you!</p><!--EndFragment-->",
