    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Organised by The Third Place, REBOOT.health 2.0 brings you another opportunity to explore Ayurveda and traditional Sri Lankan wellness practices, this time with a more hands-on and experiential approach.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Here's what makes this edition different:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">🧘 Discover practical approaches to managing migraines, recurring headaches, workplace stress, burnout and screen-related fatigue.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">🍵 Experience traditional Ayurveda herbal drinks and snacks.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">🌿 Explore traditional Ayurveda practices and how to incorporate them into everyday life.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">✨ Get introduced to simple self-care techniques and healthier daily habits you can take home and practise.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Your Investment:</p><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 🎟️ Individual: LKR 1,000 per person</p><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 👥 Groups of 3 – 5: LKR 800 per person&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Your registration includes the interactive Ayurveda Session and an opportunity to experience traditional Ayurvedic herbal refreshments.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">(Enjoy 10% OFF all beverages at The Third Place Café when you join us.)</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Event Details :-</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.95rem;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 📅 12 November 2026 (Thursday)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;⏰ 5:00 PM – 6:30 PM</p><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;📍 The Third Place Café, TRACE Expert City, Colombo 10</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Only 15 participants!</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">We're keeping this session small to create a more engaging and interactive experience.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">(For more info: 078 942 6663 - Mahdy)&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">See you at REBOOT.health 2.0!</p>",
